---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import NoteList from '../../components/NoteList.astro';
---

<Base title="笔记" active="notes" breadcrumb="notes">
  <section class="page-intro">
    <span class="eyebrow mono">LEARN IN PUBLIC</span>
    <h1>
      留一点思考的痕迹<span class="heading-dot">.</span>
    </h1>
    <p>
      记录问题、尝试和偶然发现。
      <br />
      不必每一次都有标准答案，先把思考留下来。
    </p>
  </section>
  <div class="content-notice">
    <span class="mono">NOTE</span>
    <p>以下是随第一版网站提供的示例笔记，用于展示文章排版；后续将替换为鹿屿自己的学习记录。</p>
  </div>
  <NoteList />
  <div class="notes-end mono">// more notes, more possibilities.</div>
</Base>
